MATRIX: Two-sum. Returns the index pair whose values add to the target, or an empty garage.

ESCAPE THE MATRIX

HUSTLE twosum WITH row AND target
  BUGATTI n EQUALS CALL length WITH row
  BUGATTI i EQUALS 0
  GRIND WHILE i IS LESS THAN n
    BUGATTI j EQUALS i PLUS 1
    GRIND WHILE j IS LESS THAN n
      IF CALL at (row, i) PLUS CALL at (row, j) IS THE SAME AS target THEN
        CASH OUT [i, j]
      PERIOD
      BUGATTI j EQUALS j PLUS 1
    STOP GRINDING
    BUGATTI i EQUALS i PLUS 1
  STOP GRINDING
  CASH OUT []
DONE HUSTLING

WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI CALL twosum ([2, 7, 11, 15], 9)
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI CALL twosum ([3, 2, 4], 6)
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI CALL twosum ([1, 2], 10)

BACK TO THE MATRIX
